{"item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bitesofbostonfoodtours/items/243407/", "pk": 243407, "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bitesofbostonfoodtours/", "pk": 31501, "shortname": "bitesofbostonfoodtours", "name": "Bites of Boston Food Tours", "processor_currency": "usd", "display_processor_currency": "US dollars"}, "name": "Sweet & Savory South End", "is_retail": false, "is_archived": false, "is_private": false, "color": 1, "unicode": "Sweet & Savory South End", "is_bookable_ever_by_phone": true, "sold_out_text": "SOLD OUT!", "cutoff_unreached_kind": "before-midnight", "cutoff_unreached_hours": 3.0, "is_cutoff_unreached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_unreached_call_to_book_text": "SOLD OUT!", "cutoff_reached_kind": "before-start", "cutoff_reached_hours": 1.5, "is_cutoff_reached_call_to_book": true, "cutoff_reached_call_to_book_text": "", "minimum_initial_party_size": 1, "minimum_subsequent_party_size": 1, "maximum_initial_party_size": null, "maximum_subsequent_party_size": null, "auto_open_kind": "before-start", "auto_open_hours": null, "is_waitlist_when_full": false, "is_unlisted": false, "booking_restriction": null, "is_card_required": false, "is_grouped_calendar": false, "is_free_allowed": true, "is_no_tax": true, "sortable_index": 1000, "description": "# *A taste of the historical, cultural, and truly special South End neighborhood!*\n\n*Escape the bustling downtown to enjoy Boston’s renowned local food scene in the vibrant South End neighborhood. Savor delicious dishes from a variety of cuisines while visiting beloved local restaurants, bakeries and markets.*", "description_text": "", "description_bullets": "", "seo_description": "", "location": "South End Neighborhood, Boston, MA", "booking_notes": "## Important Details / What to Bring\n\n* **Please plan to arrive 5-10 minutes early, as our tours start right on time**.\n* Please **bring bottled water** along with you to enjoy throughout the tour. Beverages are not included with all food tastings.\n* If you are consuming alcohol, please bring your **driver's license or passport!**\n* Gratuity for your tour guide is *not included in your ticket price*. If you enjoy yourself and would like to consider a tip for your tour guide, **gratuities are greatly appreciated and graciously accepted at the end of the tour.** Thanks for your consideration!\n* This tour takes place rain or shine and New England weather can be unpredictable, so **please check the weather and temperature on the day of your tour and dress for the forecast**. We have fun in all types of weather, and being prepared for the elements will go a long way in making the most of your tour experience!\n* **Please wear comfortable clothes and walking shoes. We will be outdoors and on our feet for most of the tour**, and we want you to be as comfortable as possible.\n* Taking photos is welcomed encouraged!\n___________________________________\n## Parking\n\nMeters in the South End have a 2-hour limit per block, which is not enough time to cover the full length of the tour. We recommend arriving via public transportation when possible, or parking in a lot. We have included 2 South End Parking lot options for your convenience - please see below.\n\n* **Atelier 505 Parking Garage**: Enter at 15 Warren Ave, Boston, MA 02116\n$28 for 3-10 hours - Max $38/ day (Rates as of May 2024)\nPhone: (617) 262-8426\n\n* **GTI Properties Lot #2**: 324 Albany Street, Boston, MA 02118\n*This lot is located under Interstate 93, entrance and exit on Albany Street.*\n$2.50/hr - Credit Card Only (Rates as of May 2024)\n___________________________________\n## Other FAQs\n\n**How much food can I expect to eat during the tour?**\nThis experience includes **plenty of food for a satisfying lunch!** Tastings vary in style and portion size, with some tastings served while seated inside the eatery, and others served in a more “on the go” manner. \n\n**Can children participate in the tour? What about toddlers and strollers?**\nChildren ages 12 and older are welcome to participate. This activity is not appropriate to attend with infants and, due to space limitations, strollers are not permitted on any of our tours.\n\n**Are restrooms available during the tour?**\nYes! Restrooms will be available at multiple times throughout the tour.\n\n## See You Soon,\n# Bites of Boston", "cancellation_notes": "**For Non-Refundable Tickets:** All sales are final - no refunds or exchanges.\n\n**For Refundable Tickets:** At least 48 hours notice is required in order to receive a refund. Tickets canceled less than 48 hours prior to the tour start time will not be refunded or rescheduled. Late arrivals and / or No-shows will also not be refunded or rescheduled. Thank you for your cooperation.\n\n*PLEASE CHECK YOUR EVENT DATE CAREFULLY BEFORE BOOKING.*\n\nThis experience was created as an adult activity. **We kindly ask that all guests joining our tour be at least 12 years of age.** This activity is not appropriate to attend with infants or toddlers, and strollers are not permitted on any of our tours.\n\nDue to agreements in place with our partner restaurants, there is a maximum guest capacity per tour. **EVERY participant must have a ticket to join the tour.**", "no_transportation_notes": "", "no_transportation_minutes": 15, "headline": "Discover One of Boston's Most Diverse & Delicious Neighborhoods", "short_description": "", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kgYSV06STAWxp10Pivdp", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/kgYSV06STAWxp10Pivdp", "images": [{"cls": "Image", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bitesofbostonfoodtours/items/243407/images/1111958/", "pk": 1111958, "unicode": "photo", "gallery": "carousel", "image_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/cCUzzTdJRBWiriP4wL3L", "image_cdn_url": "https://cdn.filestackcontent.com/cCUzzTdJRBWiriP4wL3L", "company": {"cls": "Company", "uri": "/api/v1/companies/bitesofbostonfoodtours/"}, "item": {"cls": "Item", "uri": "/api/v1/compan